id=tb371fc_mtd_off
name=TB371FC mtd HAL off
version=0.1-disable-mtd
versionCode=1
author=TB371FC maintainers
description=Neutralises vendor.xiaomi.hardware.mtdservice@1.3 (it retries loading the missing cardapp TA every 2s). Binds a no-op binary over /vendor/bin/mtd@1.3 and stops the running service. Remove this module to restore the original HAL.
